    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">R</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">R</mi></math>&nbsp;be two functions defined by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo></math>&nbsp;Then, for which of the following range of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>, the inequality <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;holds?",
